{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463152",
      "title": "Outputting Raw HTML Content with v-html",
      "lectureOrder": 21,
      "videoOrder": 17,
      "sourceHash": "cbd32117898e8be07838ce4c81860f409256f67f0a6e4c988147d7cf45dfda25",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.17,
          "end": 3.4,
          "en": "So at this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.4,
          "end": 7.78,
          "en": "the good news is that we covered almost all important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.78,
          "end": 10.687,
          "en": "features and functionalities that are related to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.687,
          "end": 12.21,
          "en": "outputting data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.21,
          "end": 16.27,
          "en": "namely interpolation and the v-bind directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.27,
          "end": 19.03,
          "en": "Also combined with the knowledge that you can output either",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.03,
          "end": 23.693,
          "en": "data or the result of method calls like we're doing it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.43,
          "end": 27.58,
          "en": "Now there is one more feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.58,
          "end": 30.35,
          "en": "one more directive you should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.35,
          "end": 32.28,
          "en": "Let's say one of the two goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.28,
          "end": 33.9,
          "en": "let's say course goal B",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.9,
          "end": 36.94,
          "en": "is actually not just a simple string like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.94,
          "end": 39.54,
          "en": "but this is some HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.54,
          "end": 40.7,
          "en": "And this could be a scenario",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.7,
          "end": 42.202,
          "en": "you have in application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.202,
          "end": 43.617,
          "en": "Where you, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.617,
          "end": 46.97,
          "en": "fetched a data and it should be output from a database",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.97,
          "end": 50.373,
          "en": "and from there you're getting some structured HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.47,
          "end": 54.87,
          "en": "Now if you use HTML elements in this string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.87,
          "end": 58.01,
          "en": "and you output this with interpolation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.01,
          "end": 60.26,
          "en": "So with the double curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.26,
          "end": 65.2,
          "en": "you'll see that the HTML elements are just output as text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.2,
          "end": 68.8,
          "en": "So they are not interpreted as HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.8,
          "end": 72.02,
          "en": "And that actually is a useful security feature because it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.02,
          "end": 74.89,
          "en": "protects you against cross site scripting attacks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.89,
          "end": 76.123,
          "en": "So this is good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.49,
          "end": 81.21000000000001,
          "en": "But sometimes you want to output this as HTML",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.21000000000001,
          "end": 84.16,
          "en": "and not as text that looks like HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.16,
          "end": 86.49,
          "en": "And for that you've got another directive you can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.49,
          "end": 90.07,
          "en": "And that is the v-html directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.07,
          "end": 91.76,
          "en": "We saw v-bind before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.76,
          "end": 94.07,
          "en": "V-bind can be used to bind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.07,
          "end": 97.09,
          "en": "so to set the values of attributes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.09,
          "end": 98.295,
          "en": "With v-html,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.295,
          "end": 101.737,
          "en": "you set the content between opening and closing text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.737,
          "end": 102.857,
          "en": "of an element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.857,
          "end": 104.703,
          "en": "but you now tell Vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.703,
          "end": 108.62,
          "en": "that the content should be interpreted as HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.62,
          "end": 110.241,
          "en": "So it should not be output as text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.241,
          "end": 113.52000000000001,
          "en": "as it is with double curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.52000000000001,
          "end": 116.75999999999999,
          "en": "And therefore you no longer use double curly braces here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.75999999999999,
          "end": 120.15,
          "en": "but instead, the value you pass to v-html",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.15,
          "end": 122.92,
          "en": "between the double quotes here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.92,
          "end": 126.03,
          "en": "would be coarse goal B for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.03,
          "end": 128.02,
          "en": "or also if you want it to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.02,
          "end": 130.52,
          "en": "the result of calling output goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.52,
          "end": 132.48,
          "en": "This also works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.48,
          "end": 134.07,
          "en": "And if I now reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.07,
          "end": 135.61,
          "en": "you see from time to time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.61,
          "end": 137.863,
          "en": "there's this dh2 tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 137.863,
          "end": 139.55,
          "en": "The text is just green,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 139.55,
          "end": 141.96,
          "en": "which is why you don't see it because of my styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 141.96,
          "end": 145.3,
          "en": "but this now is interpreted as HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 145.3,
          "end": 148.47,
          "en": "And of course goal A is also interpreted as HTML,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 148.47,
          "end": 151.56,
          "en": "but in there I got no HTML text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.56,
          "end": 153.94,
          "en": "So this is a feature you can use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 153.94,
          "end": 155.404,
          "en": "I'm going to comment it out here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 155.404,
          "end": 157.29,
          "en": "because we don't need it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 157.29,
          "end": 159.16,
          "en": "but I wanted to make you aware of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 159.16,
          "end": 161.77,
          "en": "If you get some contents stored in your Vue app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 161.77,
          "end": 166.77,
          "en": "which contains HTML code, that should be treated as HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 167.4,
          "end": 170.62,
          "en": "The v-html directive, which is built into Vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 170.62,
          "end": 172.26,
          "en": "will help you with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.26,
          "end": 175.44,
          "en": "Now chances are, you'll not need it too often,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.44,
          "end": 178.5,
          "en": "and you should definitely not use it as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 178.5,
          "end": 181.97,
          "en": "Because you can introduce security issues with that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 181.97,
          "end": 184.53,
          "en": "because you basically circumvent the built in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 184.53,
          "end": 186.76,
          "en": "cross site scripting attack protection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 186.76,
          "end": 189.08,
          "en": "you have with the double curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 189.08,
          "end": 190.49,
          "en": "But if you know what you're doing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 190.49,
          "end": 193.5,
          "en": "and you need to output something as HTML,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 193.5,
          "end": 196.94,
          "en": "the v-html directive is your friend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 196.94,
          "end": 197.773,
          "en": "Well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 197.773,
          "end": 200.88,
          "en": "and these are some basics about working with the Vue app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 200.88,
          "end": 203.48,
          "en": "and outputting content with data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 203.48,
          "end": 205.7,
          "en": "or with a method which you call.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 205.7,
          "end": 206.88,
          "en": "And therefore I'd say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 206.88,
          "end": 209.5,
          "en": "next it's time to practice the subject.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
